This repository distributes:
  1. Project code in `src_v3/` (excluding `src_v3/cunnsearch.cp310-win_amd64.pyd`),
     pretrained weights in `weights/`, and sample frames in `sample_data/`.
  2. Third-party components in source or binary form (`diff_gaussian_rasterization/`,
     `Dependency/diff-gaussian-rasterization/`, `src_v3/cunnsearch.cp310-win_amd64.pyd`,
     and `Falcor/`).

IMPORTANT: Because this package includes and depends on Inria/MPII
`diff-gaussian-rasterization` (non-commercial research license) as well as
redistributable binaries governed by NVIDIA and Microsoft SDK licenses, this
distribution as a whole is NOT licensed under a commercial-use or copyleft
open-source license. Each component remains governed by its own license terms
in `licenses/` and `THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md`.


